- F-179 **Tasks and transactions are implemented twice, independently: for walk in `interpreter/evaluator/tasks/` and `transactions/`, and for the compiled path in `runtimeSystem/`.** A fix in one copy does not reach the other: row 302's fix, of an eager debug message in `inATransaction`, is in the compiled copy only. Read in the code: `coordinator/map/modules-and-phases.md`, "B.11 The runtime".
